===== Aya's config files =====

This repo contains all files to create a 
good enough workstation on a new xfce void
linux install.

===== Installation =====

Here are the steps to install this config

1. Install void linux xfce (musl edition
should work but go with glibc for stability)

2. Download this repo as zip from
github.com/ayabusa/ayas-config

3. Run these commands
sudo xbps-install -u xbps unzip
cd Downloads
unzip <the downloaded file>
cd <unziped repo>

4. Run the script as root
sudo bash install-void.sh

5. Enjoy ;)

===== Notes =====

You should take into consideration the
following points before using this script.

- It configures the Xorg keyboard as french.
- It sets some function keys for managing
  windows on the screen.
- Some fonts and software are downloaded as
  AppImages or archive and should be installed
  by hand using gear lever and gnome-fonts.
- Some wallpapers are installed in ~/Pictures
